    "source": "\n**Location:** `unnamed-future-evaluation`\n\n**Frame:** The indistinct context fragment from [page 115](115.md) overlays three mutually incompatible possibilities: this book, an incident report, and an unrelated convention. All remain unreadable.\n\n**Caption:**\n> REMEMBERED? LEARNED? REDISCOVERED?\n\n**Provenance:** `invented` — questions, not claims.\n\n",
    "title": "Three unreadable origins remain mutually uncertain"
